          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">TODAY</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Twilight\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/dc3d2a52-2e0e-4621-8da8-81b3aa922487/Twilight.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #fe84da\">Star Sign Movies: Cancer</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/twilight-3033\" class=\"hover:underline\">Twilight</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sat, Jul 11</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>8:30 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">Bella Swan is an average teenager who often goes unnoticed. However, her life changes for the better when she meets Edward Cullen, a vampire with dreamy eyes and skin that sparkles in sunlight.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"dfdc8811-c78b-4ca5-992b-c6d517c77976\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"dfdc8811-c78b-4ca5-992b-c6d517c77976\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>9:00 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">TOMORROW</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Pretty Woman\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/be932c93-3a4d-4136-b882-26bf135820a2/gettyimages-168581071.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/pretty-woman-2779\" class=\"hover:underline\">Pretty Woman</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Jul 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>12:30 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">WHO KNEW IT WAS SO MUCH FUN TO BE A HOOKER?\r\n\r\nA high-flying lawyer, Edward Lewis (Richard Gere), hires a beautiful and unlikely prostitute, Vivian Ward (Julia Roberts), from Sunset Blvd to bring along to various business events. An attraction develops between the two, and Edward finds it harder and harder to let the infectious, kind-hearted Vivian go.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"a03f526c-ceb4-4fbc-9612-d873cd41121b\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"a03f526c-ceb4-4fbc-9612-d873cd41121b\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>1:00 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Men's Wimbledon Finals\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/ac5985c5-7ced-44be-b13b-da20ba1dfe21/WIMBLEDON(1920-x-1080-px).png\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #FF84DA\">Sport</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-white text-brand-navy\">Event</div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-white text-brand-navy\">Alternative Events</div>\n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/mens-wimbledon-finals-3017\" class=\"hover:underline\">Men's Wimbledon Finals</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Jul 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>3:30 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">Please note, the Wimbledon Finals on average last between 90 min and 2 hours, however, they have been known to go on for longer. Infact at 4 hours and 42 minutes, 2023 was the third-longest Wimbledon final in history by duration; the longest being the 2019 final (4 hours and 57 minutes), which also featured Djokovic, and the second longest being the 2008 final!</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"07499056-5495-4d38-9fbe-aa478a31a0a5\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"07499056-5495-4d38-9fbe-aa478a31a0a5\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>4:00 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"500 Days Of Summer\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/1604efe3-f9be-4027-b103-e72682ebf464/MV5BMTcwMTcwNzgyMV5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwMzgzNDIzMw@@._V1_.jpg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/twilight-3034\" class=\"hover:underline\">500 Days Of Summer</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Jul 12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>8:15 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">THIS IS NOT A LOVE STORY. THIS IS A STORY ABOUT LOVE.\n\nTom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"929549b7-e810-411c-bd30-9395f619090d\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"929549b7-e810-411c-bd30-9395f619090d\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>8:45 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">MON, JUL 13</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Pride & Prejudice\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/e6ad4b28-715c-4176-8437-4c95da01c204/pride-prejudice-1200x900.jpg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/pride-prejudice-2781\" class=\"hover:underline\">Pride & Prejudice</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Mon, Jul 13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>5:00 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">Mrs Bennet insists that her daughters find rich husbands and settle down. When a wealthy bachelor starts living near them, Mrs Bennet's happiness knows no bounds.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"a66beb63-85fb-48ab-ae43-c2fa55070397\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"a66beb63-85fb-48ab-ae43-c2fa55070397\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>6:00 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Notting Hill\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/f1ebde1a-0146-478c-9740-e05b77490df4/Notting-Hill-3.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/notting-hill-3043\" class=\"hover:underline\">Notting Hill</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Mon, Jul 13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>8:25 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">CAN THE MOST FAMOUS FILM STAR IN THE WORLD FALL FOR THE MAN ON THE STREET?\r\n\r\nWilliam Thacker is a London bookstore owner whose humdrum existence is thrown into romantic turmoil when famous American actress Anna Scott appears in his shop. A chance encounter over spilled orange juice leads to a kiss that blossoms into a full-blown affair. As the average bloke and glamorous movie star draw closer and closer together, they struggle to reconcile their radically different lifestyles in the name of love.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"3460a118-6634-4da3-8a95-6273668fdbb4\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n      