            "text": "\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">SAT, AUG 1</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Scarface\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/1d0c74bd-e383-4dd3-a718-521e3e224484/scarface.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #3A55C9\">Built Different</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/scarface-2817\" class=\"hover:underline\">Scarface</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sat, Aug 1</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>7:30 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">Tony Montana and his close friend Manny, build a strong drug empire in Miami. However as his power begins to grow, so does his ego and his enemies, and his own paranoia begins to plague his empire.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"67ba5bf2-506f-4f87-bdef-8c505fe9a28b\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"67ba5bf2-506f-4f87-bdef-8c505fe9a28b\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>8:30 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"screening-group mb-12 md:mb-16\">\n        <div class=\"mb-8\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-brand-navy uppercase shrink-0 pb-3\">SUN, AUG 2</h2>\n            <hr class=\"border-brand-navy\">\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"space-y-14\">\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Pride & Prejudice\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/e6ad4b28-715c-4176-8437-4c95da01c204/pride-prejudice-1200x900.jpg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/pride-prejudice-2818\" class=\"hover:underline\">Pride & Prejudice</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Aug 2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>1:15 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">Mrs Bennet insists that her daughters find rich husbands and settle down. When a wealthy bachelor starts living near them, Mrs Bennet's happiness knows no bounds.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"aeabb315-1d55-4f3b-8db6-8e7ca7b75cf6\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"aeabb315-1d55-4f3b-8db6-8e7ca7b75cf6\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>1:45 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"Romeo & Juliet\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/df8431ee-4c62-4543-9e3c-ab5e12a38aa5/romeojuliet.jpeg\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #ec3694\">Date Night</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/romeo-juliet-2819\" class=\"hover:underline\">Romeo & Juliet</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Aug 2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>4:10 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">MY ONLY LOVE SPRUNG FROM MY ONLY HATE.\r\n\r\nAgainst the urban backdrop of Verona Beach, California, the Montague and Capulet families are embroiled in a long-running feud. When Romeo, a Montague, attends a Capulet ball in disguise, he falls in love with the beautiful Juliet. Although already engaged to Dave Paris, whom she does not love, Juliet vows to marry Romeo. They ask the kindly Father Laurence to perform the ceremony in secret, but bloodshed and tragedy threaten the couple's future together.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"a92082bc-68fe-46f6-8762-e4b5b8a45efe\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-checkout-screening=\"a92082bc-68fe-46f6-8762-e4b5b8a45efe\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-navy text-brand-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-brand-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>BOOK</span>\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-normal ml-4\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg>\n                            <span>4:55 PM</span>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"screening-card grid grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr] gap-x-4 gap-y-3 md:gap-6\">\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 md:row-span-2 space-y-2\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] bg-brand-paleblue\">\n                        \n                        <img alt=\"The Sopranos\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dpgypjrov/image/fetch/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto/https://d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net/PRODUCTION/films/5bfb0190-1cd3-426c-8cea-5be64bd50cf1/The-Sopranos-(1).png\">\n                        \n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-2 md:bottom-3 md:right-3\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center text-center w-10 h-10 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl leading-none\">18+</h3>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #3156d2\">Mini Marathons</div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded text-brand-white\" style=\"background-color: #3A55C9\">Built Different</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-white text-brand-navy\">Event</div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"text-center py-1 px-2 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-brand-red text-brand-white\">Sold Out</div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-start-2 row-start-1 md:row-span-2\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-lg text-brand-navy uppercase leading-tight mb-2\"><a href=\"/uk/london/peckham/screenings/the-sopranos-3038\" class=\"hover:underline\">The Sopranos</a></h3>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 mb-2 text-brand-navy/80\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Sun, Aug 2</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 shrink-0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 3h4a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-4M10 17l5-5-5-5M15 12H3\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Doors open at <span>6:45 PM</span></span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        \n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium\">\n                            <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z\"/>\n                                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/>\n                            </svg>\n                            <span>Peckham, London</span>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                    </div>\n\n                    \n                    <p class=\"text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-navy/70 italic line-clamp-1 mb-3\">New Jersey mob boss Tony Soprano deals with personal and professional issues in his home and business life that affect his mental state, leading him to seek professional psychiatric counseling.</p>\n                    \n\n                    <button data-screening-details=\"fd3cba9d-03ba-4cd6-ba44-1d784b9ecf58\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-2 border-b border-brand-navy/40 cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-brand-navy\">More Details</span>\n                        <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <path d=\"M26.667 21.333C29.6124 21.3332 32 23.7216 32 26.667C31.9998 29.6123 29.6123 31.9998 26.667 32H5.33301C2.38774 31.9998 0.000173164 29.6123 0 26.667C0 23.7216 2.38764 21.3332 5.33301 21.333C2.38764 21.3328 0 18.9454 0 16C2.57701e-06 13.0546 2.38764 10.6672 5.33301 10.667C2.38764 10.6668 0 8.27842 0 5.33301C0.000178318 2.38775 2.38775 0.000178659 5.33301 0H26.667C29.6123 0.000176597 31.9998 2.38775 32 5.33301C32 8.27842 29.6124 10.6668 26.667 10.667C29.6124 10.6672 32 13.0546 32 16C32 18.9454 29.6124 21.3328 26.667 21.333Z\" fill=\"#5C9AC6\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M10.5 16H21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                            <path d=\"M16 10.5V21.5\" stroke=\"#F9F4EE\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1 md:col-start-3 md:row-start-1 md:row-span-2 flex items-start\">\n                    \n                    <button data-waitlist-screening=\"fd3cba9d-03ba-4cd6-ba44-1d784b9ecf58\" class=\"group/notify flex items-center justify-between w-full px-5 py-3 md:py-2.5 bg-brand-lightbeige text-brand-navy text-sm font-bold rounded-full border-2 border-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-red hover:text-brand-white hover:border-brand-red transition-colors cursor-pointer\">\n                        <span>Notify Me</span>\n                        <svg class=\"shrink-0 w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 1