          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"8134ed8b-6a7f-416c-b2be-978b15f9d2da\",\"title\":\"FINALS WORLD CUP\",\"url\":\"\\/uk\\/london\\/peckham\\/screenings\\/finals-world-cup-3015\",\"date\":\"Sun, Jul 19\",\"time\":\"8:00 PM\",\"door_time\":\"7:30 PM\",\"minimum_age\":18,\"short_description\":null,\"long_description\":\"<p>This is it.<\\/p>\\n<p>Weeks of wonder goals, shock exits, questionable refereeing decisions and endless group chat debates have all led to this: the FIFA World Cup Final.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>Join us on the rooftop as football's biggest night takes over the big screen. Grab a drink, claim your seat and prepare to spend the next couple of hours wildly celebrating, nervously pacing, or insisting \\\"there's still time\\\" with increasing desperation.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<p>One trophy. One winner. One final excuse to cancel your plans and watch football on a rooftop.<\\/p>\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dpgypjrov\\/image\\/fetch\\/f_auto,w_600,h_450,c_fill,q_auto\\/https:\\/\\/d31ni94nh7toh0.cloudfront.net\\/PRODUCTION\\/films\\/78a18051-4c93-4606-8a37-8ef7da0ee9c2\\/World-Cup-(1).png\",\"venue_title\":\"Peckham, London\",\"collections\":[{\"title\":\"Sport\",\"bg_color\":\"#FF84DA\"}],\"seasons\":[],\"tags\":[{\"title\":\"Event\"},{\"title\":\"Alternative Events\"}],\"accessibility\":[],\"sold_out\":true}",
